                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='18'>Higher percentage of arthritis in women than men. Higher rates of arthritis in the states in the center of the country rather than near the coasts.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'> There is not a large change in the amount of arthritis from location to location.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
